26
00:01:22,375 --> 00:01:25,734
Never rely on verbal agreements alone.

27
00:01:25,734 --> 00:01:30,734
If a decision, agreement, or instruction
is important, document it.

28
00:01:30,734 --> 00:01:35,534
Where appropriate, get a signature,
written acknowledgement, or confirmation through company

29
00:01:35,534 --> 00:01:36,534
